<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves firm to $3.714 bln - Aug 27.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves firm to $3.714 bln - Aug 27.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Friday said its hard currency reserves firmed to $3.714 billion as of August 27, from $3.707 billion on August 21.  HARD CURRENCY RESERVES     Aug 27   Aug 21   Aug 31 '95</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	 3.714    3.707    2.708</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	    1.234    1.201    1.588</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector     4.948    4.908    4.296</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
</text>
